                ]
              }
            },
            "type": "content"
          }
        ],
        "id": "3948310129",
        "layout": "vertical",
        "purpose": "example",
        "type": "group"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "activity_id": 79103,
            "id": "1743128500",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          }
        ],
        "id": "1128750165",
        "layout": "vertical",
        "purpose": "learnbydoing",
        "type": "group"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In one application, a 0.010-mm layer of chromium must be deposited on a part with a total surface area of 3.3 m"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " from a solution containing chromium(III) ions. How long would it take to deposit the layer of chromium if the current was 33.46 A? The density of chromium (metal) is 7.19 g/cm"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "3"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "ztduxkyo6pcs99e",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "First, compute the volume of chromium that must be produced (equal to the product of surface area and thickness):"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "m2os3c85t9amkkk",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "7vjwkyox4bj1fod",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "s1nocdgnuh436sg",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{Volume}\\;=\\;\\left(0.010\\;\\mathrm{mm}\\;\\times\\frac{1\\;\\mathrm{cm}}{10\\;\\mathrm{mm}}\\right)\\;\\times\\;\\left(3.3\\;\\mathrm m^2\\;\\times\\;\\left(\\frac{10,000\\;\\mathrm{cm}^2}{1\\;\\mathrm m^2}\\right)\\right)\\;=\\;33\\;\\mathrm{cm}^3",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Use the computed volume and the provided density to calculate the molar amount of chromium required:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "v4r60t88fkftj1f",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "zynqog1pv192i2r",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "v7v8iez0mdj3b8u",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{Mass}\\;=\\;\\mathrm{volume}\\;\\times\\;\\mathrm{density}\\;=\\;33\\;\\mathrm{cm}^3\\;\\times\\;7.19\\;{\\textstyle\\frac{\\mathrm g}{\\mathrm{cm}^3}}\\;=\\;237\\;\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm{Cr}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "g8r8y9qdz5vis1w",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "4boqm38ydd850k5",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm{Cr}\\;=\\;237\\;\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm{Cr}\\;\\times\\;\\frac{1\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm{Cr}}{52.00\\;\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm{Cr}}\\;=\\;4.56\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm{Cr}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The stoichiometry of the chromium(III) reduction process requires 3 moles of electrons for each mole of chromium(0) produced, and so the total charge required is:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "8vsv5xplhk6wajv",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "z15vfr5xlcx6f00",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "8u7riez6mnt5n8k",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "Q\\;=\\;4.56\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm{Cr}\\;\\times\\;\\frac{3\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm e^-}{1\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm{Cr}}\\;\\times\\;\\frac{96,485\\;\\mathrm C}{1\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm e^-}\\;=\\;1.32\\times10^6\\;\\mathrm C",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Finally, if this charge is passed at a rate of 33.46 C/s, the required time is:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "g6ujk2yhc7clrrk",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "vj75sm74ds83zjd",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "q6n4kh0990e8lxs",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "t\\;=\\;\\frac QI\\;=\\;\\frac{1.32\\times10^6\\;\\mathrm C}{33.46\\;\\mathrm C/\\mathrm s}\\;=\\;3.95\\times10^4\\;\\mathrm s\\;=\\;11.0\\;\\mathrm{hr}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1533573295",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
